Z||000012||Pontiaddict||06-24-2001||03:58 AM||||I just saw it tonight (techincally yesterday) and thought it was rather lame.<BR>If I had to relate it to another movie it would be "Hackers", funny but not really good. I wouldn't have gone to see it since it was about as bad as I expected it to be, but some friends of mine wanted to see it and I had some time and $7 to kill.<P>So going through your list (why not?)<BR>1: I spend too much time here to not like cars.<BR>2: Well, that depends on the type of racing.<BR>3: I only saw about 5 minutes of "Stepmom" (not that I wanted to see it anyway either) and although I can't realy make a comparison based on 5 minutes of a movie, "The Fast and the Furious" wasn't quite as bad but I still shouldn't have bothered to go see it in the theater.<P>Of course I only had to see "The Matrix" once before ripping the plot to shreds.<P>I guess I'm just not a movie person.||||reg||1
